        "\\paragraph{Dataset Statistics}\n",
        "The majority of the questions in \\dataset have float and integer as the answers, which is more realistic than the existing multi-choice datasets like ScienceQA~\\cite{lu2022learn} or AQuA QA~\\cite{ling2017program}. Therefore, the models are unlikely to take shortcuts to achieve high accuracy. \n",
